section#about.about-banner
  div
    h2.about-banner-title
      | About
      br
      | Me.
  .about-banner-body
    p
      | Hi, I&apos;m Phoebe &mdash; a developer, artist, and lifelong learner based in Kampala, Uganda.
      | I hold a Bachelor of Science in Counseling Psychology and I am currently pursuing
      | a Postgraduate Diploma in Information Technology at Uganda Management Institute,
      | deepening my knowledge in computing systems, networking, databases, and ICT management.
    p
      | I trained at Refactory Academy where I studied the foundations of software development,
      | covering HTML, CSS, JavaScript, GitHub, GitLab, and object-oriented development.
      | I have since built websites, web applications, and e-commerce platforms using
      | WordPress, Webflow, WooCommerce, Elementor, Pantheon, and Node.js.
      | I am currently expanding my skills by learning React.
    p
      | Beyond coding, I am also a passionate artist who loves to draw and create.
      | Art has always shaped the way I think about design, colour, and user experience.
      | I believe that great websites are not just functional &mdash; they are also beautiful,
      | and I carry that belief into every project I build.
    br
    a.btn-cv(href='/My-CV.pdf' download='')
      | Download My CV
    a.btn-cv(href='/contact') Hire Me
